1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 22]</font>

15
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry</font>

16
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for failing you.</font>

17
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle escaped.</font>

18
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

19
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">please rise.</font>

20
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've obtained evidence</font>

21
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Changle's profiteering</font>

22
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and faction-forming over these years.</font>

23
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is just struggling desperately.</font>

24
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is nothing to be feared.</font>

25
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A cunning rabbit has three burrows.</font>

26
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She has thrived for so many years.</font>

27
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her foundations run deep.</font>

28
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must not let down your guard.</font>

29
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Last night's incident
caused such a great uproar.</font>

30
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the dead
were all nobles of high birth.</font>

31
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone might exploit this</font>

32
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to stir up trouble.</font>

33
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still no word on Prince Duan?</font>

34
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Among the bodies found so far,</font>

35
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was not among them.</font>

36
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suspect</font>

37
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was taken by Changle.</font>

38
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether Prince Duan can survive</font>

39
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">depends entirely on his own fate.</font>

40
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will continue to send men to search.</font>

41
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured, Your Majesty.</font>

42
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:56,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suspect those male servants who died</font>

43
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the Princess's mansion</font>

44
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were taken out through here
and disposed of.</font>

45
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just wonder</font>

46
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where this secret passage leads.</font>

47
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are we?</font>

48
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whose men are you?</font>

49
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need to ask.</font>

50
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are death warriors</font>

51
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've trained for years,</font>

52
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and they obey only my command.</font>

53
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All these years,</font>

54
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've acted recklessly on the surface,</font>

55
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet secretly,
you've schemed quite a bit.</font>

56
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a plan today,</font>

57
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and I was hoping you could advise me.</font>

58
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if I were</font>

59
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to give these dozen death warriors</font>

60
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">each a Thunderbolt Bomb</font>

61
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and have them sneak</font>

62
00:04:04,640 --> 00:04:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the Imperial Palace</font>

63
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and light them one by one?</font>

64
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chaos in Beiyuan.</font>

65
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The people would suffer.</font>

66
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:17,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what you want, isn't it?</font>

67
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not just that.</font>

68
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I let the Emperor know
you've returned</font>

69
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and your life is hanging by a thread,</font>

70
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would he come to see you here?</font>

71
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I hide a few Thunderbolt Bombs</font>

72
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">under your bed,</font>

73
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once the Emperor draws near...</font>

74
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Boom!</font>

75
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just like fireworks,</font>

76
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">blooming one after another.</font>

77
00:04:52,760 --> 00:04:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a beautiful sight that would be.</font>

78
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You madwoman.</font>

79
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai.</font>

80
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bring Prince Duan out here.</font>

81
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see just how tough</font>

82
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a dying man's mouth</font>

83
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be.</font>

84
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Young Master,</font>

85
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:41,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you always give General Li</font>

86
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this thumbs-up sign.</font>

87
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does it mean?</font>

88
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When it's up,</font>

89
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it means Wei is home.</font>

90
00:05:46,720 --> 00:05:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When it's down,</font>

91
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it means Wei is not home.</font>

92
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei is still alive.</font>

93
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may have a sharp tongue,</font>

94
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you have a handsome face.</font>

95
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I can seize power,</font>

96
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would surely be the most favored.</font>

97
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In your dreams!</font>

98
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards! Guards!</font>

99
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

100
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai.</font>

101
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've dreamed of this scene</font>

102
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a thousand times.</font>

103
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Death warriors!</font>

104
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill them!</font>

105
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill them now!</font>

106
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said Wei is alive.</font>

107
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is she?</font>

108
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan, working
at the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

109
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:56,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan?</font>

110
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The coroner?</font>

111
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

112
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it you, Your Highness?</font>

113
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing here?</font>

114
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:16,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

115
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

116
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really is you.</font>

117
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're up ahead!</font>

118
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After them!</font>

119
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:25,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quickly!</font>

120
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me the fire piston.</font>

121
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

122
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Careful.</font>

123
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

124
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

125
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you all right?</font>

126
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

127
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

128
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you wounded?</font>

129
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should ask your dear brother.</font>

130
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's the Shadow Master.</font>

131
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Shadow Master?</font>

132
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

133
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is no place for a reunion.</font>

134
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get out of here first.</font>

135
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, we must go.</font>

136
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Move.</font>

137
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, let's go.</font>

138
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay alert.</font>

139
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

140
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch out.</font>

141
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

142
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, his leg is stuck.</font>

143
00:08:35,400 --> 00:08:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we force it,</font>

144
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his leg will be ruined.</font>

145
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have an idea.</font>

146
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's much smarter than you.</font>

147
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides brains,</font>

148
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">being quick on your feet matters too.</font>

149
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

150
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing, nothing.</font>

151
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It'll be fine in a moment.</font>

152
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just don't look back.</font>

153
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:28,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Snakes!</font>

154
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up, you two.</font>

155
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up.</font>

156
00:09:31,800 --> 00:09:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, you go first.</font>

157
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I came down here,</font>

158
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never planned on leaving alive.</font>

159
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There, it's done.</font>

160
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

161
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's collapsing! Let's leave now.</font>

162
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's an exit ahead.</font>

163
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

164
00:09:59,280 --> 00:09:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

165
00:09:59,880 --> 00:10:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out.</font>

166
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, you go first.</font>

167
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

168
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

169
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will avenge the Princess!</font>

170
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

171
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll drag you down with me.</font>

172
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

173
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

174
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

175
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

176
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

177
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

178
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

179
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

180
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He won't survive.</font>

181
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll share the same quilt in life</font>

182
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the same grave in death.</font>

183
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he can't come out,</font>

184
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will go in and stay with him.</font>

185
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

186
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

187
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

188
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- I finally found you!
- Chief!</font>

189
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is still inside.</font>

190
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you waiting for? Start digging!</font>

191
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

192
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's too dangerous over there.
Come here.</font>

193
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's alright now.</font>

194
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince...</font>

195
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

196
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, are you hurt?</font>

197
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We found him!</font>

198
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wonderful.</font>

199
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wonderful.</font>

200
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

201
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We need to talk.</font>

202
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

203
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Soldiers are searching everywhere.</font>

204
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't stay here long.</font>

205
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before the soldiers arrive,</font>

206
00:12:11,880 --> 00:12:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we must leave at once.</font>

207
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:13,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave?</font>

208
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can we?</font>

209
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince hasn't woken yet.</font>

210
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The situation was dire before,</font>

211
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I indulged your foolishness.</font>

212
00:12:18,560 --> 00:12:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you forget</font>

213
00:12:19,280 --> 00:12:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that the death of our parents</font>

214
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is tied to his family.</font>

215
00:12:22,480 --> 00:12:23,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you still see me as your brother,</font>

216
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give up any thought
of being with Li Congyao.</font>

217
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:26,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether he lives or dies</font>

218
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:27,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has nothing to do with you.</font>

219
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

220
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he risked his life</font>

221
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to secure His Majesty's pardon
for our family.</font>

222
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can we abandon him now?</font>

223
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's a lie to fool you,</font>

224
00:12:36,400 --> 00:12:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you took it seriously?</font>

225
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wasn't lying.</font>

226
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The secret edict is in my room.
I'll show you.</font>

227
00:12:41,760 --> 00:12:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he meant to deceive you,</font>

228
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">forging a fake would be simple.</font>

229
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen to me. Don't be foolish.</font>

230
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just leave.</font>

231
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not leaving.</font>

232
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Until he wakes,</font>

233
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't go anywhere.</font>

234
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu,</font>

235
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how is the Prince's injury?</font>

236
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The wound is not serious.</font>

237
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

238
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I found a fang mark from a snake bite</font>

239
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on the Prince's left foot.</font>

240
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The snake's fangs carry venom.</font>

241
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone bitten by it</font>

242
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will surely die</font>

243
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the venom.</font>

244
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then the Prince...?</font>

245
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun,</font>

246
00:13:11,360 --> 00:13:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do not be alarmed.</font>

247
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just took</font>

248
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince's pulse.</font>

249
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The poison in his body</font>

250
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has actually receded considerably.</font>

251
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

252
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the cobra venom</font>

253
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">counteracted the Prince's poison.</font>

254
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has slowed</font>

255
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the poison's spread in his body.</font>

256
00:13:31,880 --> 00:13:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One might say</font>

257
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's a blessing in disguise.</font>

258
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician Liu, do you mean</font>

259
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince's poison can be cured?</font>

260
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I can find this cobra,</font>

261
00:13:41,920 --> 00:13:43,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll study it thoroughly.</font>

262
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I may not be able
to cure him completely,</font>

263
00:13:46,960 --> 00:13:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it's likely</font>

264
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I can stabilize</font>

265
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince's condition.</font>

266
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wonderful.</font>

267
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

268
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:56,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is my duty.</font>

269
00:14:36,280 --> 00:14:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard</font>

270
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have an important matter</font>

271
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to report to me in private.</font>

272
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am here now.</font>

273
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak.</font>

274
00:14:43,920 --> 00:14:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If not for your men</font>

275
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">discovering me early,</font>

276
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would have suffocated</font>

277
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in that tunnel.</font>

278
00:14:55,240 --> 00:14:57,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am willing to tell you something</font>

279
00:14:58,360 --> 00:15:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of great importance concerning Beiyuan</font>

280
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as long as you're willing</font>

281
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to spare my life.</font>

282
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are a condemned, dying man.</font>

283
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why should I trust you?</font>

284
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai, the eldest son</font>

285
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of Governor Qin,</font>

286
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is still alive.</font>

287
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Impossible.</font>

288
00:15:21,760 --> 00:15:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was executed five years ago.</font>

289
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Princess liked him.</font>

290
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She had ways to save his life.</font>

291
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke, just visit Prince Duan's Mansion,</font>

292
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and you will know</font>

293
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if my words are true.</font>

294
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if they're true,</font>

295
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he is just the son of a spy.</font>

296
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He can't cause much trouble.</font>

297
00:15:47,440 --> 00:15:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I have to say</font>

298
00:15:49,640 --> 00:15:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">does not stop there.</font>

299
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you</font>

300
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">verify this matter,</font>

301
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can come back</font>

302
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and ask me.</font>

303
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke...</font>

304
00:16:10,040 --> 00:16:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Duke Dingguo's Mansion]</font>

305
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan,</font>

306
00:16:30,640 --> 00:16:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what are you doing in the study?</font>

307
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm looking for a book.</font>

308
00:16:33,800 --> 00:16:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you here for?</font>

309
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With Changle's fall,</font>

310
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:38,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the streets are in complete chaos.</font>

311
00:16:38,480 --> 00:16:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're hunting the remnants everywhere,</font>

312
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I couldn't even see Jun</font>

313
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

314
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father even scolded me for that.</font>

315
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you help me</font>

316
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">figure something out?</font>

317
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's Father?</font>

318
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father?</font>

319
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't even mention him.</font>

320
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He forbade me from going.</font>

321
00:16:54,760 --> 00:16:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet he rushed off</font>

322
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to visit Prince Duan.</font>

323
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, no.</font>

324
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

325
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to visit Prince Duan as well.</font>

326
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be</font>

327
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:05,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the new code for going there now?</font>

328
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:07,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for me. I'm coming too.</font>

329
00:17:08,280 --> 00:17:10,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

330
00:17:11,150 --> 00:17:12,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

331
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

332
00:17:16,740 --> 00:17:21,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

333
00:17:21,420 --> 00:17:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

334
00:17:25,410 --> 00:17:29,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

335
00:17:29,930 --> 00:17:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

336
00:17:34,260 --> 00:17:39,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

337
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

338
00:17:47,070 --> 00:17:50,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

339
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:55,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

340
00:17:55,670 --> 00:17:58,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

341
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:03,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

342
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:08,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
